      "content": "but i really dont think i need an ambulance... i've been having these same feelings for like a week whenever i have a big meeting. it usually goes away if i just sit down and take some deep breaths. plus im such a worrier, my doctor always tells me my heart is fine and its just stress. do you think it could just be a panic attack or something similar?",
